# Cloudflare static-asset response headers (copied to out/_headers by `next build`).
# Phase 10: service worker and cache behavior. Content-Security-Policy is defined and audited in
# Phase 12 (SECURITY E.12). Supabase responses never pass through these rules: they come from
# the Supabase origin, and the service worker never caches them (features/offline/sw.ts).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

# The browser must always see the newest worker; a new version then waits for the next launch.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# Content-hashed build files never change under the same URL.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
